    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There has been an accident at the witch's hut! Violet the Witch was making a potion when her cat accidentally knocked the wrong bottle into the cauldron, creating a portal that let in magical beings from other worlds.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339510/extras/9feeaebccd6f93b0656c633ed8f5a1a9.poster.avif?t=1739819016\" width=600 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339510/extras/9feeaebccd6f93b0656c633ed8f5a1a9.webm?t=1739819016\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339510/extras/9feeaebccd6f93b0656c633ed8f5a1a9.mp4?t=1739819016\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your task is to explore different places and find all the creatures to bring them back to their homes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339510/extras/195f374497d0a74f782c4606744a0b5c.poster.avif?t=1739819016\" width=600 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339510/extras/195f374497d0a74f782c4606744a0b5c.webm?t=1739819016\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339510/extras/195f374497d0a74f782c4606744a0b5c.mp4?t=1739819016\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >400 unique creatures to find</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 different locations to explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom made sounds for all creatures</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There has been an accident at the witch's hut! Violet the Witch was making a potion when her cat accidentally knocked the wrong bottle into the cauldron, creating a portal that let in magical beings from other worlds.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339510/extras/9feeaebccd6f93b0656c633ed8f5a1a9.poster.avif?t=1739819016\" width=600 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339510/extras/9feeaebccd6f93b0656c633ed8f5a1a9.webm?t=1739819016\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339510/extras/9feeaebccd6f93b0656c633ed8f5a1a9.mp4?t=1739819016\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your task is to explore different places and find all the creatures to bring them back to their homes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339510/extras/195f374497d0a74f782c4606744a0b5c.poster.avif?t=1739819016\" width=600 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339510/extras/195f374497d0a74f782c4606744a0b5c.webm?t=1739819016\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339510/extras/195f374497d0a74f782c4606744a0b5c.mp4?t=1739819016\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >400 unique creatures to find</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 different locations to explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom made sounds for all creatures</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>",
